      "text": "in shadow of his hand he hath hid me, 1 Ne. 21:2 (2 Ne. 8:16; Isa. 49:2; 51:16). tabernacle shall be for shadow in daytime from heat, 2 Ne. 14:6 (Isa. 4:6). the Lord shows many types and shadows to his people, Mosiah 3:15. what Noah3 will do with Abinadi shall be type and shadow of things to come, Mosiah 13:10. law of Moses is shadow of things to come, Mosiah 16:14. God has no shadow of turning from right to left, Alma 7:20. workings of Liahona are not without shadow, Alma 37:43. no shadow of changing in God, Morm. 9:10.",
